    "# Business Insights\n",
    "\n",
    "### Key Observations\n",
    "\n",
    "- Historical silver prices exhibit periods of high and low volatility.\n",
    "- Rolling volatility highlights unstable market conditions.\n",
    "- Maximum drawdown identifies the largest historical decline.\n",
    "- Ensemble forecasting provides more stable predictions than a single model.\n",
    "- XGBoost and Random Forest generally outperform simpler regression approaches.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Recommendations\n",
    "\n",
    "- Monitor volatility before making trading decisions.\n",
    "- Use ensemble predictions for improved forecasting stability.\n",
    "- Update forecasting models regularly using new market data.\n",
    "- Combine macroeconomic and technical indicators to improve future forecasts."
